OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome long clear spells, allowing some
OL,7,Fareas of mist and fog to develop. A
OL,8,Flittle more breezy in the far north,
OL,9,Fperhaps limiting fog amounts here. A
OL,10,Fchilly night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FOnce any fog clears during
OL,13,FMonday morning, dry and feeling very
OL,14,Fwarm by afternoon, with sunny spells.
OL,15,FSunshine possibly hazy at times,
OL,16,Fespecially in north and west, given
OL,17,Fhigh cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
