OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FOvernight fog clearing Tuesday
OL,7,Fmorning, then rain overnight. Likely
OL,8,Fwet on Wednesday with a risk of heavy,
OL,9,Fthundery rain. Drier later. Cooler
OL,10,FThursday but mostly dry with sunny
OL,11,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
